#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose whether to restore open sessions on startup, remember history and "
"passwords, display a system tray icon or status bar, and preserve the aspect "
"ratio when scaling. You can also configure the default protocol, initial "
"host configuration dialog, window resizing, automatic full screen and "
"keyboard grabbing, and tab appearance and closing behavior."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hosts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a saved host and click <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton> to change "
"its protocol settings. <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> deletes the saved host "
"configuration. Bookmarks and connection history are managed separately."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable or disable installed protocol plugins. Restart &krdc; after changing "
"plugin availability. The configuration button of a protocol plugin opens its "
"default settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid "VNC settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:458
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>VNC Defaults</guilabel> tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>VNC</guilabel> tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica <guilabel>VNC Zadane postavke</guilabel>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:464
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>VNC Defaults</guilabel> profiles tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>VNC</guilabel> profiles tab"
msgstr ""
"&krdc; postavke - kartica profila <guilabel>VNC Zadane postavke</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Connection type:</guilabel> offers <guilabel>High Quality (LAN, "
"direct connection)</guilabel>, <guilabel>Medium Quality (DSL, Cable, fast "
"Internet)</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Low Quality (Modem, ISDN, slow "
"Internet)</guilabel>. Choose a quality appropriate to the whole connection, "
"including the remote computer's network link. A lower quality can help on "
"slow connections."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Scale to Size:</guilabel> sets the size used to display the remote "
"desktop, with predefined and custom dimensions. The password-manager option "
"prevents sending clipboard content marked as a password by supported "
"password managers, such as KeePassXC. It cannot identify passwords copied by "
"applications that do not provide that marker."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "RDP settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The RDP configuration dialog contains the following tabs. Changes to "
"connection settings may take effect only after reconnecting."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">General</emphasis>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:494
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - General tab"
msgid "&krdc; RDP preferences - General tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica Općenito"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:500
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP Defaults</guilabel> tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP</guilabel> general tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica <guilabel>RDP Zadane postavke</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab controls the appearance of the remote "
"desktop, input devices, and resources shared with the remote session."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Resolution</guilabel> selects the desktop size requested from the "
"server. Choose a preset, the current window or screen size, or a custom "
"width and height. <guilabel>Use All Screens Resolution</guilabel> requests a "
"multi-monitor session; in full screen, the remote monitors are displayed on "
"the corresponding local screens. Availability depends on the server and your "
"local display configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Scale window contents to match resolution</guilabel> controls "
"local image scaling. <guilabel>Desktop scale factor:</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Device scale factor:</guilabel> instead specify scaling "
"information sent to the server. Use these to adjust the size of remote "
"interface elements on high-resolution displays, where supported by the "
"server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Acceleration:</guilabel> selects the graphics encoding mode, "
"including H.264, RemoteFX, or disabling acceleration. <guilabel>Color depth:"
"</guilabel> controls the number of colors used for the remote desktop; some "
"acceleration modes require 32-bit color. <guilabel>Keyboard layout:</"
"guilabel> should match the keyboard you use so that key presses are "
"interpreted correctly."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Sound:</guilabel> selects playback on this computer, playback on "
"the remote computer, or no sound. <guilabel>Share Media:</guilabel> makes a "
"local directory available to the remote session; leave it empty to disable "
"drive sharing. <guilabel>Share Smartcard:</guilabel> specifies the smartcard "
"name to redirect to the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Admin (or console) session</guilabel> requests an administrative "
"session on servers that support it. <guilabel>Prevent remote session lock</"
"guilabel> sends periodic simulated mouse activity to keep the session "
"active; server policies may still enforce locking."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:544
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - General tab"
msgid "&krdc; RDP preferences - Security tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica Općenito"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:550
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP Defaults</guilabel> tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP</guilabel> security tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica <guilabel>RDP Zadane postavke</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Security</guilabel> tab controls which security methods &krdc; "
"offers when establishing the RDP connection. The <guilabel>NLA</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>TLS</guilabel>, <guilabel>RDP</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Ext</"
"guilabel> check boxes enable the corresponding FreeRDP security modes. More "
"than one can be enabled so that the client and server can negotiate a "
"compatible method."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>TLS security level:</guilabel> sets the cryptographic security "
"level required for TLS connections. A higher level imposes stricter "
"requirements and may prevent connections to older servers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:567
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Authentication Package List:</guilabel> passes a custom selection "
"of authentication packages to FreeRDP. Leave it empty to use the default "
"behavior, or enter the value supplied by your administrator. Change security "
"options to match the server's requirements."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:572
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:576
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - General tab"
msgid "&krdc; RDP preferences - Proxy tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica Općenito"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:582
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP Defaults</guilabel> profiles tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP</guilabel> proxy tab"
msgstr ""
"&krdc; postavke - kartica profila <guilabel>RDP Zadane postavke </guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Proxy</guilabel> tab configures a network proxy used for the "
"connection. Select <guilabel>HTTP</guilabel> or <guilabel>SOCKS</guilabel> "
"in <guilabel>Protocol:</guilabel>, then enter the proxy address in "
"<guilabel>Server:</guilabel> using the form <userinput>host:port</userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:593
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the proxy requires authentication, fill in <guilabel>Username:</guilabel> "
"and <guilabel>Password:</guilabel> with the proxy credentials. These may "
"differ from the credentials for the remote desktop. Leave <guilabel>Server:</"
"guilabel> empty when no proxy is needed. The target remote desktop address "
"remains the address entered on the connection page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:603
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - General tab"
msgid "&krdc; RDP preferences - Gateway tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica Općenito"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:609
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP Defaults</guilabel> tab"
msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>RDP</guilabel> gateway tab"
msgstr "&krdc; postavke - kartica <guilabel>RDP Zadane postavke</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Gateway</guilabel> tab configures access through an RDP "
"gateway, which provides a route to a remote desktop on another network. "
"Enter the gateway address in <guilabel>Server:</guilabel> as <userinput>host:"
"port</userinput>, using the port supplied by your administrator. Keep the "
"destination computer's address on the main connection page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the gateway account's <guilabel>Domain:</guilabel>, <guilabel>Username:"
"</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Password:</guilabel> as required. These fields "
"authenticate access to the gateway; the remote desktop may require separate "
"credentials."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Transport type:</guilabel> offers <guilabel>Auto</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>HTTP</guilabel>, and <guilabel>RPC</guilabel>. Use <guilabel>Auto</"
"guilabel> unless your administrator specifies a transport. Leave the gateway "
"<guilabel>Server:</guilabel> field empty when connecting without an RDP "
"gateway."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If SSH tunnel support is available, an additional <guilabel>SSH tunnel</"
"guilabel> tab appears in the host configuration dialog. See <xref linkend="
"\"ssh-tunnels\"/> for its options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:638
#, no-c-format
msgid "SPICE settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:642
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
