#~ msgid ""
#~ "Remote Frame Buffer (or <acronym>RFB</acronym> for short) is a simple "
#~ "protocol for remote access to graphical user interfaces. It works at the "
#~ "frame-buffer level, which roughly corresponds to the rendered screen "
#~ "image, which means that it can be applied to all windowing systems "
#~ "(including X11, &MacOS; and &Microsoft; &Windows;). Remote Frame Buffer "
#~ "applications exist for many platforms, and can often be free re-"
#~ "distributed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Remote Frame Buffer (ili kratko <acronym>RFB</acronym>) je jednostavi "
#~ "protokol za udaljeni pristup za korisničke grafičke interfejse, koji "
#~ "grubo odgovaraju na usluženu sliku zaslona (uključujući X11, &MacOS; i "
#~ "&Microsoft; &Windows;). Remote Frame Buffer aplikacije postoje za mnoge "
#~ "platforme, i često mogu biti besplatno redistribuirane."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In the Remote Frame Buffer protocol, the application that runs on the "
#~ "machine where the user sits (containing the display, keyboard and "
#~ "pointer) is called the client. The application that runs on the machine "
#~ "where the framebuffer is located (which is running the windowing system "
#~ "and applications that the user is remotely controlling) is called the "
#~ "server. &krdc; is the &kde; client for the Remote Frame Buffer protocol. "
#~ "&krfb; is the &kde; server for the Remote Frame Buffer protocol."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "U Remote Frame Buffer protokolu, aplikacija koja je pokrenuta na mašini "
#~ "gdje korisnik sjedi(sadržavajući zaslon, tastaturu i miš) se naziva "
#~ "klijent. Aplikacija koja je pokrenuta na mašini gdje je framebuffer "
#~ "smješten (koji pokreče sistem prozora i aplikacija koje korisnik udaljeno "
#~ "kontroliše) se naziva server. &krdc; je za &kde; klijent za Remote Frame "
#~ "Buffer protokol. &krfb; je za &kde; server za   Remote Frame Buffer "
#~ "protokol."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "It takes a reasonable amount of network traffic to send an image of the "
#~ "framebuffer, so Remote Frame Buffer works best over high bandwidth links, "
#~ "such as a local area network. It is still possible to use &krdc; over "
#~ "other links, but performance is unlikely to be as good."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "To zahtijeva razumnu količinu mrežnog saobraćaja da se pošalje slika "
#~ "framebuffer-a, tako da  Remote Frame Buffer najbolje radi preko visoke "
#~ "propusnosti linkova, kao što je lokalna mreža. Ipak je moguće koristiti "
#~ "&krdc;  preko drugih linkova, ali su performanse riskantne da bi bile "
#~ "dobre."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "It is very easy to use &krdc; - it has a simple interface, as shown in "
#~ "the screenshot below."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Veoma je lako koristiti &krdc; - ima jednostavan interfejs, kao što je "
#~ "prikazano na slici ispod."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&krdc; is a client, and it needs to be used with compatible servers. "
#~ "There are different ways to connect to those servers:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&krdc; je klijent, i mora biti korišten sa kompatibilnim serverima. "
#~ "Nekoliko je različitih načina da se poveže na te servere:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Directly typing the server name (or IP address) into the "
#~ "<guilabel>Connect to:</guilabel> input."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Direktno kucajući ime servera (ili IP adresu) u <guilabel>Poveži se na:</"
#~ "guilabel> ulaz."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "By using an invitation that you received. &krfb; uses invitations, and "
#~ "can send them by email."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Koristeći pozivnicu koju ste primili. &krfb; koristi pozivnice, i može ih "
#~ "slati putem email-a."

#~ msgid "Let's look at each of these in turn."
#~ msgstr "Pogledajmo svaki od njih još jednom."

#~ msgid "Server name entry"
#~ msgstr "Unos imena servera"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you know the host name (or IP address) of the server you want to "
#~ "connect to, you can enter it directly into the <guilabel>Connect to:</"
#~ "guilabel> input."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ako znate ime domaćina (ili IP adresu) servera sa kojim se želite "
#~ "povezati, možete ga upisati direktno u <guilabel>Poveži se na:</guilabel> "
#~ "ulaz."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you want to connect to a machine named megan, which is running a "
#~ "<acronym>VNC</acronym> server on screen 1 (5901), you can enter "
#~ "<userinput>megan:1</userinput> or <userinput>megan:5901</userinput> and "
#~ "choose <guilabel>vnc</guilabel> as the protocol in the drop down box."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ako se želite povezati na mašinu koja se zove megan, na kojoj je pokrenut "
#~ "<acronym>VNC</acronym> server na zaslonu 1 (5901), možete unijeti "
#~ "<userinput>megan:1</userinput> ili <userinput>megan:5901</userinput> i "
#~ "izabrati <guilabel>vnc</guilabel> kao protokol u opadajućem izborniku."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Similary, if you are using a <acronym>RDP</acronym> server on that "
#~ "machine, you can enter <userinput>megan</userinput>. Choose "
#~ "<guilabel>rdp</guilabel> as the protocol. <acronym>RDP</acronym> does not "
#~ "need the screen number to be specified. If the server runs the "
#~ "<acronym>RDP</acronym> server not on the default port, you may specify it "
#~ "in the following way: <userinput>megan:3910</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Slično, ako koristite <acronym>RDP</acronym> server server na toj mašini, "
#~ "možete unijeti <userinput>megan</userinput>. Izaberite <guilabel>rdp</"
#~ "guilabel> kao protokol. <acronym>RDP</acronym> ne zahtijeva da broj "
#~ "zaslona bude specificiran. Ako server ne pokrene <acronym>RDP</acronym> "
#~ "server na zadanom ulazu , možete to specificirati na sljedeći način: "
#~ "<userinput>megan:3910</userinput>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You need to enter an &URL; in percent encoded syntax, i.e. @ as %40, for "
#~ "&eg; <userinput>username%40ad.domain.example</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Trebate unijeti &URL; sa postotkom šifrovanom sintaksom, i.e. @ as %40, "
#~ "for &eg; <userinput>username%40ad.domain.example</userinput>"

#~ msgid "Using an invitation"
#~ msgstr "Korištenje pozivnice"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Within the &krfb; server application, it is possible to send invitations "
#~ "over email (and in other ways, although email is the most useful). If you "
#~ "receive this type of email invitation, you can just click on the link "
#~ "provided in the mail. This will start &krdc; if it is not already "
#~ "running, and connect to the server specified in the invitation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sa &krfb; server aplikacijom, moguće je slati pozivnice putem email-a (i "
#~ "na druge načine, mada je email najkorišteniji). Ako primite ovu vrstu "
#~ "pozivnice, kliknite na link  koji Vam je proslijeđen na mail. Ovo će "
#~ "pokrenuti &krdc; ako nije već pokrenut, i povezati se na server "
#~ "specificiran pozivnicom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Notice: Before connecting, ensure that the target computer (server) is "
#~ "available on the network and, if necessary, that its firewall has been "
#~ "correctly configured or disabled."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Primijetite: Prije povezivanja, uvjerite se da je ciljani kompjuter "
#~ "(server) dostupan na mreži i, ukoliko je potrebno, da mu je firewall "
#~ "ispravno konfiguriran ili isključen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "No matter how you select the server to connect to, the next thing that "
#~ "happens is that &krdc; asks you about the network connection to the "
#~ "server, as shown below:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nebitno na koji način odaberete server za povezivanje, sljedeća stvar "
#~ "koja će se desiti je da Vas &krdc; pita za povezivanje na server, kao što "
#~ "je prikazano ispod:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There are three speed settings for the <acronym>VNC</acronym> protocol:"
#~ msgstr "Postoje tri moguće postavke za <acronym>VNC</acronym> protokol:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "High Quality (LAN, direct connection), which is the default, and you "
#~ "should evaluate how well this setting performs before selecting a lower "
#~ "performance option that uses less bandwidth."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Visoki kvalitet (LAN, directno povezivanje), koje je zadano, i trebali "
#~ "biste procijeniti koliko su dobre performanse ovih postavki prije nego "
#~ "odaberete opciju slabijih performansi koje koriste manju propusnost."

#~ msgid "Medium Quality (DSL, Cable, fast Internet)."
#~ msgstr "Srednji kvalitet (DSL, Kabl, brzi Internet)."

#~ msgid "Low Quality (Modem, ISDN, slow Internet)."
#~ msgstr "Niska kvaliteta (Modem, ISDN, spori Internet)."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You select the appropriate speed setting, and select the <guibutton>OK</"
#~ "guibutton> to proceed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Odaberite prikladne postavke brzine, i odaberite <guibutton>OK</"
#~ "guibutton> da nastavite."

#~ msgid "You can see the connection status in the icon in the tab."
#~ msgstr "Možete vidjeti status povezivanja na ikoni na kartici."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Depending on the configuration of the server, you may (and almost "
#~ "certainly will) need to provide a password to authenticate to the server. "
#~ "&krdc; will provide a password dialog similar to that shown below."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "U ovisnosti od konfiguracije servera, možda ćete (a najvjerovatnije "
#~ "hoćete) trebati unijeti šifru da potvrdite server. &krdc; će izbaciti "
#~ "mali dijalog sa šifrom, kao što je prikazano ispod:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&krdc; has the ability to save the password for further connections to "
#~ "the same host. It uses KWallet for doing this. You need to check the "
#~ "<guibutton>Remember password (KWallet)</guibutton> check box if you like "
#~ "to use this feature."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&krdc; ima mogućnosti da sačuva šifru za sljedeća povezivanja na istog "
#~ "domaćina. Koristi KWallet za ovo. Trebate označiti <guibutton>Zapamti "
#~ "šifru (KWallet)</guibutton> ukoliko želite koristiti tu mogućnost."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "After authentication, you will be connected to the remote server, and can "
#~ "begin using &krdc; to observe or control the remote desktop."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nakon provjere autenticnosti, bit ćete povezani sa udaljenim serverom, i "
#~ "moći ćete početi koristiti &krdc; da posmatrate ili upravljati udaljenim "
#~ "desktopom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Having connected to the remote server, you would normally use the "
#~ "keyboard and mouse to control the windowing system and applications on "
#~ "that remote machine."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kada se povežete sa udaljenim serverom, normalno ćete koristiti tastaturu "
#~ "i miš da kontrolišete prozore i aplikacije na udaljenoj mašini."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You can view the remote desktop either as a full screen, or as a window "
#~ "on the local desktop. You can change between these modes using icons "
#~ "shown below."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Udaljeni desktop možete pregledati na cijelom zaslonu, ili kao prozor na "
#~ "lokalnom desktopu. Možete mijenjati između ovo dvoje korištenjem ikona "
#~ "koje su prikazane ispod."

#~ msgid "<screeninfo>&krdc; full screen mode selection</screeninfo>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<screeninfo>&krdc; odabir prikaza preko cijelog zaslona</screeninfo>"

#~ msgid "<phrase>&krdc; full screen mode selection</phrase>"
#~ msgstr "<phrase>&krdc;odabir prikaza preko cijelog zaslona</phrase>"

#~ msgid "<screeninfo>&krdc; window mode selection</screeninfo>"
#~ msgstr "<screeninfo>&krdc; odabir pregleda preko prozora</screeninfo>"

#~ msgid "<phrase>&krdc; window mode selection</phrase>"
#~ msgstr "<phrase>&krdc; odabir pregleda preko prozora</phrase>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Full screen mode is normally better when you are helping a remote user, "
#~ "because you can see all of what they can see. Window mode is most useful "
#~ "when you are working both remotely and locally - perhaps referring to "
#~ "some local documentation and then using those instructions on the remote "
#~ "machine."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prikaz preko cijelog zaslona je inače bolji kada pomažete udaljenom "
#~ "korisniku, zato što tako možete vidjeti sve što oni vide. Pregled preko "
#~ "prozora je najkorisniji kada paralelno radite i na udaljenom i na "
#~ "lokalnom zaslonu - na primjer kada pozivajući se na neke lokalne "
#~ "dokumente koristite te instrukcije na udaljenoj mašini."

#~ msgid "Using window mode"
#~ msgstr "Korištenje prozora"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In window mode, you can terminate the connection by closing the window, "
#~ "by clicking on the logout button."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Korištenjem prozora možete prekinuti vezu zatvaranjem prozora, pritiskom "
#~ "na dugme za odjavu."

#~ msgid "Using full screen mode"
#~ msgstr "Korištenje cijelog zaslona"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In full screen mode, you can change the appearance of the toolbar. The "
#~ "transparency of the toolbar can be changed with scrollwheel."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Korištenjem prikaza preko cijelog zaslona, možete promijeniti prikaz na "
#~ "alatnoj traci.  Prozirnost alatne trake može biti promijenjena na "
#~ "kotačiću za listanje."

#~ msgid "Bookmarks"
#~ msgstr "Oznake"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&krdc; has the ability to manage bookmarks. If you need to connect often "
#~ "to the same remote desktop, you can add an entry for this connection to "
#~ "the bookmark list. You can do so with a click on "
#~ "<menuchoice><guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Bookmark</"
#~ "guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&krdc; ima mogućnost za upravljanje oznakama. Ako trebate da se povežete "
#~ "sa nekim udaljenim desktopom, možete dodati unos za ovu vezu u listu "
#~ "oznaka. To možete uraditi klikom na <menuchoice><guimenu>Oznake</guimenu> "
#~ "<guimenuitem>Doraj oznaku</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#~ msgid "History Bookmarks"
#~ msgstr "Historija oznaka"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&krdc; saves last used remote desktop connections. You can access these "
#~ "special bookmarks at <menuchoice><guimenu>Bookmarks</"
#~ "guimenu><guimenuitem>History</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Of course you "
#~ "can also delete a bookmark of this list if you don't need it anymore in "
#~ "the list. Just click <guibutton>Delete Bookmark</guibutton> which appears "
#~ "after a click with the right mouse button on the bookmark you would like "
#~ "to delete."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&krdc; spašava posljednje korištene veze sa udaljenim desktopom. Ovim "
#~ "posebnim oznaka možete pristupiti na <menuchoice><guimenu>Oznake</"
#~ "guimenu><guimenuitem>Historija</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Naravno, "
#~ "oznake sa ove liste možete i obrisati ukoliko ih ne trebate više na "
#~ "listi. Samo kliknite dugme <guibutton>Obriši oznaku</guibutton> koje se "
#~ "pojavi nakon što kliknete desno dugme miša na oznaku koju želite obrisati."

